<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Use a device you trust before entering important credentials. The aim is to check security events, devices, recovery methods, forwarding and connected accounts without turning one unfamiliar event into a definite breach conclusion.</p>{% call note("care", "Take care", "protect funds first") %}<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If a bank account, card or payment detail may be involved, contact the bank immediately using an official app, statement or independently located website. Do not wait for an appointment.</p>{% endcall %}
